            <p>Clicks the "Know Your Clients" button and validates correct page navigation and heading visibility.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>From dashboard → Click "Know Your Clients" button.</step>
            <step>Confirm that the URL path is "/main/clients".</step>
